SUMMARY:🕯️ גולדה יארצייט תזכורת
DTSTART:20270125T163000
DTEND:20270125T163000
UID:reminder-20270125-ad8ec8b6-1
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
X-MICROSOFT-CDO-BUSYSTATUS:FREE
DESCRIPTION:Hebcal joins you in remembering גולדה\, whose 14th Yahrze
 it occurs on Tuesday\, January 26\, corresponding to the 18th of Sh’vat\
 , 5787.\n\nגולדה’s Yahrzeit begins at sundown on Monday\, January 2
 5 and continues until sundown on the day of observance. It is customary to
  light a memorial candle at dusk as the Yahrzeit begins.\n\nMay your loved
  one’s soul be bound up in the bond of eternal life and may their memory
  serve as a continued source of inspiration and comfort to you.
